{"articleNo":"576285","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=576285&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] AI중심대학 캐나다 MITACS GRI Program 참가자 선발 안내","writer":"AI중심대학사업단","writeDate":"2026.09.04","hit":"5598","attachments":[{"name":"AI중심대학 캐나다 MITACS GRI(Globalink Research Internship) Program 참가자 선발 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=576285&attachNo=167862"},{"name":"붙임1. 2026년 AI·SW중심대학 캐나다 MITACS GRI Program 선발 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=576285&attachNo=167863"},{"name":"붙임2. 2026-2027 GRI Program guide.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=576285&attachNo=167864"},{"name":"붙임3. AI중심대학 캐나다 MITACS Program 참가 신청서 및 개인정보이용동의서_양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=576285&attachNo=167865"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQTkhpApgIQO4EcDKBBAFgKQFEAJAO2IHkBVYgV3QDcGA6AB1IHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국립금오공과대학교 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중심대학사업단에서는 학생들에게 캐나다 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">연구기관에서의 연구 프로젝트 참여 기회를 제공하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">글로벌 연구 역량과 국제적 진로 탐색 능력을 강화하기 위하여 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">MITACS GRI(Globalink Research Internship) Program</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참가자를 선발합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아래 사항과 첨부자료를 확인하여 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">프로그램명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: MITACS GRI(Globalink Research Internship) Program</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">파견 국가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">캐나다</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">파견 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2027</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">~10</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월 중 약 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10~12</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">주</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">주요 활동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:19.4pt;text-indent:-19.4pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">캐나다 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">연구기관에서 소프트웨어 개발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">데이터 분석 및 논문 조사 등의 연구 프로젝트 수행</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- MITACS </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">협력기관과의 연구 인턴십 매칭</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">글로벌 연구 프로젝트 참여를 통한 연구 역량 강화 및 진로 탐색</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원 내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">인당 총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">12,000 CAD </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">현금 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">왕복 항공료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">비자 발급비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">생활비 및 숙박비 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">현물 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">의료보험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학생 멘토링</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">프로젝트 매칭 및 행정 지원 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청 방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2026. 9. 7.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) 12:00</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출서류를 담당자 전자우편으로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: [tldus1900@kumoh.ac.kr]</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">대한민국 국적자로서 해외 출국 및 비자 발급에 결격사유가 없어야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">인턴십 기간 중 다른 정부 지원 해외 인턴십 또는 해외 업무경험 사업에 중복 참여할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국가연구개발사업 참여 제한 대상자는 지원할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출서류의 허위 사실 또는 지원 자격 미충족 등의 결격사유가 확인되면 선발이 취소될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">최종 선발 후 개인 사유로 참가를 취소하는 경우 항공권 및 숙박비 취소 수수료는 본인이 부담합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">문의</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">프로그램 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">디지털인재확산팀 남동건 선임</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">☎ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">042-612-8453 / [donggeon@iitp.kr]</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청서 제출 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국립금오공과대학교 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0